infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Strict vs relaxed layering: isolation vs pragmatism
  desc Same four layers — the difference is which calls a layer is allowed to skip
  compares
    - label Strict layering — depend only on the layer directly below
      children
        - label Strongest isolation
          desc Domain tested with zero database, queue, or external service
        - label Foundation for hexagonal & clean architecture
          desc Strict layering taken to its logical conclusion (units 04-05)
        - label Costs discipline + boilerplate
          desc Every call goes through an interface; more ceremony to maintain
    - label Relaxed layering — call any layer below, skipping levels
      children
        - label Pragmatic for simple CRUD
          desc No empty application-layer pass-through where it adds no value
        - label Erodes more easily
          desc Once skipping is allowed for convenience, the discipline slips
        - label Drifts toward boundary violations
          desc Ends with presentation importing repository classes directly
theme
  palette #6366f1 #f59e0b
